flowchart TB
    subgraph Preparation[Corpus preparation]
      W[WikipediaLoader: one string per query] --> C[Deduplicated JSON snapshot + content hash]
      C --> E[1000-character passages / 150 overlap + DatabricksEmbeddings]
      E --> F[(FAISS index + source metadata)]
    end
    subgraph Application[LangGraph application]
      I[User assertion paragraph] --> X[ClaimExtractor: AUTHOR_PROMPTS extractor]
      X --> R[Two dense queries / rank fusion / 4 passages]
      R --> V[Verifier: AUTHOR_PROMPTS verifier + Python quote checks]
      V -->|sufficient or no useful new query| M[Quality metrics]
      V -->|insufficient + new query| T[One retry: search + append 2 passages + reverify]
      T --> M
      M --> O[Deterministic cited report]
    end
    F -.-> R
    F -.-> T
    G[Hand-labelled diagnostic claims] -. bypass extraction .-> R
    O -. evaluation run only .-> A[Accuracy / per-class accuracy / citation coverage / abstentions / errors]
    subgraph PromptLoop[Prompt engineering loop - offline, promptfoo]
      P1[Business goal + labelled evals: 30 verifier claims, 8 extractor paragraphs] --> P2[5 scored tuning rounds on databricks-meta-llama-3-1-8b-instruct]
      P2 --> P3[Final verifier 26/30, extractor 8/8]
    end
    P3 -. AUTHOR_PROMPTS .-> X
    P3 -. AUTHOR_PROMPTS .-> V
    A -.-> L[Live golden-set run on Databricks Free Edition serverless: 6/6 correct, citation coverage 100%, databricks-bge-large-en embeddings]
